{
 "checkpoint": "CP-60",
 "about": "Planted faults (>=2 per category) and valid counterexamples. Each case starts from a base design, applies the listed edits to the compiled grid (never to labels), and states which check must fail and where. Positions are design coordinates. Bases: hut5 (examples/hut5.py), cabin/two_storey/tower (examples/*.eve), or inline layers. scaffold: plan = eve_design.scaffold.plan, none = no scaffold. bom: true computes bom.json for the affordability check.",
